implementationPlan.description:
Adversarial self-review (load adversarial-self-review) of the five-file diff. Check:
- the off-by-one at the cap: 65536 is read and 65537 refused;
- short reads are looped;
- the descriptor is closed on every path, the throw included;
- no whole-file read of daemon.json is left in src (grep readFileSync; benchmarks/baselineRun.ts is out of scope because it reads its own temp project);
- no deletion and no kill for an oversize file;
- doctor's message carries no file content;
- concurrent start/stop calls share no state;
- valid files behave exactly as before.
Residual, noted only: opening a FIFO blocks, but git cannot commit a FIFO. The proxy, Claude plugin, VS Code and launcher readers have sibling rows. If the review changes bytes, re-run the step 3 gate fresh. Report all five paths in complete_step.modifiedFiles.

